  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "队员被神秘能量束缚，任何人拉开过远都会让整队回到起点",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The main thing is not to stray too far from each other, otherwise... ready, set, go — back to the beginning!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3771740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "向上攀爬时难度持续抬升，不同区域会更换建筑结构、节奏和陷阱逻辑",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The world is one, but the levels in it are completely different. Architecture, pace, traps — everything is constantly changing so that you don't relax and think, “Well, now it will definitely be easier.”",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3771740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "配乐会随安全与高压跳跃场景切换，从舒缓背景转为强化紧张感",
      "dimension": "画风",
      "excerpt": "The soundtrack changes with you. Calm moments sound pleasant... and then the platform with millimeter jumps begins, and the sound abruptly ceases to be background noise.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3771740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
